{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">九號信號下，各區風勢和雨勢加劇。截至凌晨4時，當局共收到27宗塌樹報告，一男一女在風暴期間受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在堅尼地城海旁，凌晨三時許風力強勁，不時有巨浪拍岸，海面可以說是波濤洶湧。巨浪更衝上行車路，足見其威力，駛經的車要減速行駛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026i6957le1cI1785012132.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026XCGmp5zuur1785012145.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026RDhO88RrTk1785012172.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">向來當風的杏花邨，午夜過後雨勢增強，海邊不時有湧浪拍岸，有寄居蟹懷疑被巨浪沖上岸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400_004.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20263wOCDX0fWG1785012194.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TYPHOON.MIDNIGHT-0400_004.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而在尖沙咀海旁，九號信號生效後，風力亦明顯增強，但仍有市民不理天文台勸諭，外出釣魚或散步。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">曾先生指出：「很不錯、好舒服，不會太大風，差不多。之前有樹倒塌，不過今次無樹倒下，沒有太理會，照常跑步。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">惠州旅客王先生說：「颱風天，來拍一下(照片)，現在強度不算大，現在還站得住，沒有說會吹走的那種。要是風力再大一點、會吹走就不行。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T21:18:39.054732+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}